          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.40+NUM.3.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.40",
              "NUM.3.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “All of Israel's firstborn sons belong to me. So register by name every firstborn male Israelite, one month old or older. But in place of them I claim all the Levites as mine! I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.40+NUM.3.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.40",
              "NUM.3.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "! I also claim the livestock of the Levites in place of all the firstborn of the livestock.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.40+NUM.3.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.40",
              "NUM.3.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
